      { question: "What is the capital gains tax rate for a trust in 2026?", answer: "A trust pays 0% on long-term capital gains up to $3,300, 15% between $3,300 and $16,250, and 20% above $16,250, before any Net Investment Income Tax that applies to undistributed gains." },
